cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use spenso, cite the version-specific Zenodo DOI for the version you
  used.
title: spenso
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Huber
    given-names: Lucien
    affiliation: University of Bern
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5074-7313"
abstract: >-
  The complete spenso software family comprises spenso, spenso-macros,
  spenso-hep-lib, and spynso3. It provides fast and flexible tensor networks,
  automatic abstract-index matching, and tensor contraction for high-energy
  physics.
keywords:
  - tensor networks
  - tensor contraction
  - abstract indices
  - high-energy physics
  - Rust
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alphal00p/gammaloop"
